<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM first-half detailed revenues and costs.</title>
<headline>KLM first-half detailed revenues and costs.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996/97 to Sept 30.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES</p>
<p>    KLM passenger traffic (billions)    3.46  vs  3.18</p>
<p>    KLM cargo traffic			  827  vs   809</p>
<p>Traffic revenues of other</p>
<p>    consolidated companies		   338  vs   same</p>
<p>    Total traffic revenues (billions)   4.62  vs  4.33</p>
<p>    Other revenues			     652  vs   615</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billions) 5.28  vs  4.94</p>
<p>OPERATING COSTS</p>
<p>    Salaries/benefits (billions)	  1.46  vs  1.31</p>
<p>    Aircraft fuel				522  vs   416</p>
<p>    Materials/consumables		    293  vs   299</p>
<p>    Commercial costs			   512  vs   480</p>
<p>    Landing/navigation charges	     422  vs   386</p>
<p>    Third-party handling costs	     178  vs   157</p>
<p>    Work by third parties		    350  vs   294</p>
<p>    Depreciations				441  vs   422</p>
<p>    Operational lease expenses		81  vs    26</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous				756  vs   653</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
